WEBVTT

00:11.860 --> 00:13.740
<i>No one is available to answer your call.</i>

00:14.140 --> 00:16.930
<i>Please leave a message after the beep.</i>

00:17.630 --> 00:19.740
<i>Hello, Yukichi?</i>

00:20.190 --> 00:22.750
<i>Sorry, I don't need dinner tonight.</i>

00:23.300 --> 00:25.830
<i>Actually, tonight...</i>

00:25.830 --> 00:27.840
<b>Maru: Kyushu Cuisine</b>

00:27.840 --> 00:30.050
Cheers!

00:31.650 --> 00:33.340
I feel a little bad about this.

00:33.740 --> 00:37.390
I can't believe so many people were 
able to gather on such short notice!

00:37.390 --> 00:40.060
It just shows how popular 
you are, Director Narita.

00:41.390 --> 00:44.230
You're always such a smooth talker, Orizuka!

00:46.900 --> 00:49.230
Let's go all-out tonight!

00:51.520 --> 00:54.310
Please stay awake, Director!

00:54.990 --> 00:58.280
Get home safe, everyone.

00:58.280 --> 00:59.990
We'll be heading home first!

00:58.950 --> 00:59.990
Let's go.

01:04.340 --> 01:06.760
Looks like we'll make the last train.

01:06.760 --> 01:10.240
I was worried when we were 
all told to gather up...

01:11.450 --> 01:14.560
I'll be heading home, too. 
Good work everyone.

01:15.490 --> 01:17.640
Good work today!

01:18.070 --> 01:21.620
Fukuzawa-san drank hard as ever tonight.

01:22.320 --> 01:28.400
We didn't have to drink as much since she 
and Chief Orizuka took the hits for us.

01:28.800 --> 01:32.050
She drank so much, but she 
doesn't look drunk at all!

01:32.050 --> 01:33.900
She's amazing.

01:57.350 --> 02:01.970
I'm home, Yukki-chan!

02:02.330 --> 02:06.430
I wanted to see you!

02:22.780 --> 02:29.960
<b>The Masterful Cat
Is Depressed Again Today</b>

03:36.980 --> 03:40.650
Can

03:36.980 --> 03:40.650
<b>A Masterful Cat Is Popular</b>

03:40.780 --> 03:41.990
<b>A Masterful Cat Is Popular</b>

03:40.860 --> 03:41.990
Can

03:43.470 --> 03:50.220
I'm so sorry I couldn't eat dinner tonight.

03:50.220 --> 03:52.410
The managing director 
suddenly wanted to drink...

03:52.410 --> 03:56.000
Don't throw any of it away. 
I'll eat it tomorrow.

03:59.800 --> 04:02.010
What is this gentle aroma?

04:08.060 --> 04:09.850
Clam miso soup!

04:14.510 --> 04:16.860
I can feel my liver coming back to life.

04:16.860 --> 04:19.360
<b>Makeup Removal Sheets</b>

04:17.550 --> 04:18.500
And...

04:18.500 --> 04:19.360
<i>Cleansing.</i>

04:19.360 --> 04:22.570
Our managing director is a bottomless
 pit when it comes to alcohol!

04:22.570 --> 04:25.830
He won't go down no matter how 
many glasses we make him drink!

04:25.830 --> 04:28.280
Doesn't he know his employees 
have an early morning meeting?

04:28.280 --> 04:29.700
<i>Shower.</i>

04:30.830 --> 04:34.080
<i>Waterproofed and in 
stand-by mode in case of falls.</i>

04:35.110 --> 04:36.580
<i>Dryer.</i>

04:37.510 --> 04:38.600
<i>Ramune candy.</i>

04:40.290 --> 04:42.590
<i>Taking in glucose via ramune candy.</i>

04:40.340 --> 04:42.590
Taking in glucose 
with ramune candy
 (to prevent hangovers)

04:42.590 --> 04:45.590
Rooibos

04:42.590 --> 04:45.590
Tea Bags

04:42.630 --> 04:45.590
Hot rooibos tea
(countermeasure for swelling)

04:42.990 --> 04:44.650
<i>Hot rooibos tea.</i>

04:49.970 --> 04:51.620
It smells so nice.

04:53.350 --> 04:55.600
<i>Full body massage.</i>

05:08.510 --> 05:09.620
<i>Face pack.</i>

05:12.810 --> 05:13.980
<i>Five minutes.</i>

05:16.870 --> 05:19.380
<i>Leather deodorizing spray.</i>

05:24.650 --> 05:26.070
<i>Steam iron.</i>

05:27.660 --> 05:29.800
<i>Sports drink.</i>

05:30.510 --> 05:32.100
<i>Hot eye mask.</i>

05:34.100 --> 05:35.220
<i>Finished.</i>

05:47.030 --> 05:49.320
Morning, Yukichi.

05:50.830 --> 05:54.240
Sorry, but I don't feel like 
eating breakfast today.

05:54.240 --> 05:56.880
I feel sick to my stomach...

05:57.380 --> 05:59.830
Wait! What's that smell?!

05:59.830 --> 06:01.560
Thanks for the meal!

06:00.880 --> 06:03.090
Clam ochazuke
 (with pickles)

06:01.560 --> 06:03.090
<i>Clam ochazuke.</i>

06:05.770 --> 06:09.710
I can feel myself absorbing the clams, 
green onions, and ginger.

06:09.710 --> 06:13.520
They're the three sacred treasures
 of everyone who loves alcohol.

06:29.240 --> 06:31.030
Good morning, Yuri-chan.

06:31.030 --> 06:34.190
G-Good morning...

06:34.190 --> 06:36.700
Why are you looking at me like 
I'm some sort of monster?

06:37.090 --> 06:39.580
I went ahead and set up the meeting room.

06:39.580 --> 06:43.920
She must have been born with 
a different liver than other people.

06:43.920 --> 06:46.710
Her ability to hold her
 liquor is too ridiculous.

06:47.790 --> 06:49.930
Oh, are you feeling hungover?

06:51.110 --> 06:52.550
Have some ramune candy!

06:52.550 --> 06:54.010
Oh, thanks...

06:54.760 --> 06:56.660
I'll treasure it as a family heirloom.

06:56.660 --> 06:59.180
Don't say things like that. 
Get a hold of yourself!

06:59.530 --> 07:04.820
How can you come to work so refreshed 
after drinking that much last night?!

07:04.820 --> 07:07.940
Not only are you not hungover, but I also 
don't see any swelling or patchy skin!

07:08.590 --> 07:10.470
<i>She's eating it after all.</i>

07:11.630 --> 07:15.210
I want to put a camera in your apartment, Senpai.

07:15.210 --> 07:16.200
Don't!

07:17.270 --> 07:17.950
Your cat...

07:18.790 --> 07:20.970
There's not a single cat hair on you, either!

07:20.970 --> 07:24.290
How does anyone manage 
to stay free of cat hair?!

07:24.290 --> 07:30.300
Oh! That?! Um, it's because my cat's 
favorite hobby is using lint rollers.

07:31.340 --> 07:32.840
D-Don't be mistaken!

07:32.840 --> 07:36.510
I'm not saying he can
 actually <i>use</i> a lint roller!

07:36.510 --> 07:39.180
Oh, there are cats like that sometimes.

07:39.180 --> 07:41.740
Are there? Really?!

07:41.740 --> 07:42.660
Yes.

07:42.660 --> 07:44.400
Really?

07:47.720 --> 07:49.400
Stare...

07:51.610 --> 07:55.910
Roll

07:52.310 --> 07:55.910
I see, some cats are like that.

07:54.200 --> 07:55.910
<b>Stare...</b>

07:56.260 --> 07:58.230
<i>Fur and smell.</i>

08:08.290 --> 08:10.080
I'm home, Yukichi!

08:12.420 --> 08:15.310
We're having beef stroganoff 
today, aren't we?

08:15.310 --> 08:18.180
It smelled so good outside!

08:22.030 --> 08:24.720
What's this wonderful fragrance?!

08:24.480 --> 08:25.190
Toasty

08:24.720 --> 08:29.040
You must have done the laundry, sunbathed, 
and baked bread with the bread machine!

08:25.190 --> 08:25.940
Toasty

08:25.940 --> 08:26.690
Toasty

08:26.690 --> 08:27.440
Toasty

08:27.440 --> 08:28.190
Toasty

08:27.980 --> 08:30.190
Beep

08:28.190 --> 08:28.940
Toasty

08:28.940 --> 08:29.690
Toasty

08:29.040 --> 08:30.190
Where's the bread?!

08:29.690 --> 08:30.190
Toasty

08:32.200 --> 08:33.700
So delicious!

08:34.820 --> 08:40.490
I've reached the point where I can tell what 
you've done all day by sniffing your fur!

08:40.490 --> 08:44.800
You changed softeners, too. 
I bet this changes your opinion of me, huh?

08:44.370 --> 08:46.710
<b>Eyes that see
 a pervert</b>

08:47.150 --> 08:49.240
<i>Thank you very much.</i>

09:05.730 --> 09:07.910
Good morning, Yukichi-chan.

09:07.910 --> 09:09.310
Here's the neighborhood circular.

09:11.870 --> 09:13.990
Did you get a little bigger again?

09:17.290 --> 09:20.830
Oh, that's right. It seems we 
don't have enough volunteers lately.

09:21.620 --> 09:26.000
I'm a part of the volunteer group myself. 
You should come join us, Yukichi-chan.

09:28.710 --> 09:32.340
<b>Recruiting! Volunteers needed
to clean the park!

 ◯ Month △ Day 8:30
 Kuroyoshi Park</b>

09:41.450 --> 09:44.700
You're the new cleaning volunteer?

09:44.700 --> 09:47.910
We'd even borrow a 
cat's paw at this point...

09:48.660 --> 09:51.020
An actual cat!

09:51.020 --> 09:55.230
I-I didn't know that cats 
got this big nowadays!

09:56.050 --> 09:59.560
Hey, now. Do we have 
gloves that'll work on him?

10:00.240 --> 10:03.040
Oh! You brought your own! That's great!

10:03.770 --> 10:06.540
Yukichi-chan, you came!

10:08.060 --> 10:10.040
You know him, Mei-san?

10:10.040 --> 10:11.860
This is Yukichi-chan.

10:11.860 --> 10:15.360
He's a very dexterous cat 
so he'll be a great help!

10:15.360 --> 10:16.940
He's super strong!

10:19.540 --> 10:21.120
With those hands of his?!

10:21.120 --> 10:24.510
I mean, we said we'd even 
borrow a cat's paw, but...

10:24.510 --> 10:28.010
Whoa! Wait a sec there!

10:29.120 --> 10:31.550
H-H-Hold on there!

10:31.550 --> 10:33.540
Sorry for doubting you.

10:33.540 --> 10:37.360
What're you planning to 
do with those shears?!

10:37.360 --> 10:37.940
Huh?!

10:37.940 --> 10:41.070
Hey, now! There he goes again!

10:43.950 --> 10:46.450
Again?!

10:50.950 --> 10:52.460
<i>Cats!</i>

10:52.460 --> 10:55.150
Isn't that above and beyond dexterous?

10:55.150 --> 10:56.960
Just what I'd expect from Yukichi-chan.

10:57.940 --> 11:02.260
Well, I still feel like I'm dreaming, but...

11:02.680 --> 11:10.310
Since we managed to finish cleaning up 
way ahead of schedule, why don't we...

11:11.810 --> 11:15.320
play some rounds of gateball!

11:15.320 --> 11:18.820
You're really quick on the uptake!

11:23.200 --> 11:27.520
<i>On this day, the gateball team 
that went on hiatus</i>

11:27.520 --> 11:29.730
<i>due to lack of players resumed activity.</i>

11:33.790 --> 11:35.000
What's that?

11:35.000 --> 11:37.000
New cleaning equipment?

11:37.340 --> 11:39.520
<i>They gave him one of their old gateball sticks.</i>

12:05.260 --> 12:07.160
Oh! Yukichi-chan!

12:07.520 --> 12:09.570
Did a kitten run your way?

12:09.570 --> 12:12.120
Oh! Dai-chan! There you are!

12:12.120 --> 12:13.810
H-Hold on to her!

12:13.810 --> 12:16.760
She escaped by opening 
a hole in the screen door!

12:22.220 --> 12:24.370
Thank you, Yukichi-chan!

12:24.370 --> 12:27.890
Goodness, Dai-chan must've 
really wanted to see you.

12:29.120 --> 12:30.770
Oh, you don't recognize her?

12:30.770 --> 12:35.620
She's the kitten that you 
and the little girl picked up.

12:51.160 --> 12:55.670
I'm taking care of her while her 
family is gone on a family trip.

12:56.150 --> 12:59.090
Looks like she remembers you.

13:00.640 --> 13:04.260
Even though she completely forgot me.

13:04.850 --> 13:06.380
Oh, goodness.

13:06.380 --> 13:08.890
I need to go out for a bit.

13:09.530 --> 13:13.390
Sorry, but can you put her 
in her crate for me?

13:27.200 --> 13:29.220
You'll stay with her, Yukichi-chan?

13:29.220 --> 13:31.660
Oh, I would really appreciate that!

13:31.660 --> 13:34.860
Then please watch the house for me.

13:34.860 --> 13:38.670
Her things are in that paper bag.

13:38.670 --> 13:41.550
I'll leave things to you, Yukichi-chan.

13:54.980 --> 13:58.160
<i>A cat that feels restless 
when there's nothing to do.</i>

14:04.940 --> 14:08.950
<b>Rub</b>

14:07.690 --> 14:08.640
<i>Pang!</i>

14:43.360 --> 14:44.320
Pong

14:44.610 --> 14:45.320
Shtonk

14:45.400 --> 14:46.070
<b>Whew</b>

14:46.360 --> 14:47.360
<b>Eeek!</b>

14:57.580 --> 15:00.370
<i>He was forced to do it over and over again.</i>

15:13.850 --> 15:17.470
I'm home, Yukichi-chan! Dai-chan!

15:20.540 --> 15:23.600
I bought some seaweed and bonito flakes!

15:24.700 --> 15:26.730
Was everything all right?

15:31.850 --> 15:33.240
Yukichi-chan?

15:37.050 --> 15:38.500
Oh, my.

15:41.270 --> 15:45.130
Really! What a masterful cat.

15:50.780 --> 15:52.300
I'm home!

15:53.380 --> 15:55.910
I'm hungry, Yukichi!

15:55.910 --> 15:58.070
So fluffy!

15:58.450 --> 16:00.270
<i>He's going to cluck his tongue at me again.</i>

16:03.210 --> 16:05.060
Huh?! Huh? Huh?!

16:09.100 --> 16:11.210
Huh? Huh? Huh?!

16:11.210 --> 16:13.880
What happened, Yukichi?! 
Did you hit your head?

16:14.280 --> 16:16.730
Your toe beans feel so good!

16:17.780 --> 16:21.730
Do you think Dai-chan is 
trying to walk on two legs?!

16:18.160 --> 16:19.160
Sway

16:20.040 --> 16:21.000
Sway

16:21.730 --> 16:23.180
So cute!

16:22.000 --> 16:23.000
Sway

16:23.180 --> 16:25.880
Maybe she'll start walking 
around on two legs eventually!

16:23.790 --> 16:24.290
<b>Wow</b>

16:23.790 --> 16:25.790
<b>Charming</b>

16:23.960 --> 16:24.370
Sway

16:24.290 --> 16:24.790
<b>Wow</b>

16:24.710 --> 16:25.130
Sway

16:24.790 --> 16:25.290
<b>Wow</b>

16:25.290 --> 16:25.790
<b>Wow</b>

16:25.460 --> 16:25.880
Sway

16:25.790 --> 16:26.290
<b>Wow</b>

16:25.880 --> 16:28.270
We should make an Ista account for her!

16:26.170 --> 16:26.670
<b>Charming</b>

16:26.210 --> 16:26.630
Sway

16:26.290 --> 16:26.790
<b>Wow</b>

16:26.790 --> 16:27.290
<b>Wow</b>

16:26.960 --> 16:27.380
Sway

16:27.290 --> 16:27.790
<b>Wow</b>

16:27.710 --> 16:28.130
Sway

16:27.790 --> 16:28.290
<b>Wow</b>

16:27.790 --> 16:28.550
<b>Charming</b>

16:28.270 --> 16:29.800
Yeah! Yeah!

16:28.290 --> 16:28.800
<b>Wow</b>

16:28.460 --> 16:28.880
Sway

16:28.800 --> 16:29.300
<b>Wow</b>

16:29.050 --> 16:29.800
<b>Charming</b>

16:29.210 --> 16:29.630
Sway

16:29.300 --> 16:29.800
<b>Wow</b>

16:44.060 --> 16:45.930
Yuri-chan!

16:46.910 --> 16:50.070
Are you about to eat lunch? 
It's pretty late.

16:50.390 --> 16:51.510
Oshiro-san.

16:51.510 --> 16:52.970
Can I eat lunch with you?

16:52.970 --> 16:54.090
Of course.

16:54.090 --> 16:58.680
I was waiting for Saku-senpai, 
but her meeting is running long...

16:59.750 --> 17:01.410
Fukuzawa again?

17:03.220 --> 17:08.170
A lot of my coworkers have been 
asking if Fukuzawa is single or not.

17:08.170 --> 17:11.170
I've even been asked to 
invite her to our singles meet-ups!

17:11.720 --> 17:13.440
You organize meet-ups?

17:13.440 --> 17:15.050
Every once in a while.

17:15.050 --> 17:16.330
Please invite me, too!

17:16.330 --> 17:18.550
Who's asking? A different unit?!

17:18.970 --> 17:20.250
I get it.

17:20.250 --> 17:24.310
She's beautiful, skilled, gets along well 
with others, and she's even good at cooking.

17:24.310 --> 17:30.570
She can hold her liquor, and she's always 
at the top of her game the next day.

17:24.830 --> 17:26.440
Thank you very much.

17:27.270 --> 17:28.480
No, no.

17:29.700 --> 17:33.570
Yes, this case should be 
considered resolved now.

17:30.570 --> 17:33.580
Saku-senpai is really high-spec, isn't she?

17:34.970 --> 17:35.820
But...

17:37.370 --> 17:41.950
She was a completely different person 
when she first transferred here.

17:42.870 --> 17:44.700
Details, please.

17:45.330 --> 17:49.980
Fukuzawa joined us three years ago 
in the middle of the year.

17:49.980 --> 17:53.350
She always looked so pale 
and acted nervously,

17:53.350 --> 17:55.420
even when she didn't make any mistakes.

17:55.420 --> 17:58.500
Like, "I'm sorry. I'm sorry."

17:58.500 --> 17:59.680
What?

17:59.680 --> 18:02.680
I can't even imagine her like that!

18:03.050 --> 18:06.290
I was a little worried about her, 
so I checked in on her every once in a while.

18:10.630 --> 18:12.350
<i>That's rare.</i>

18:12.350 --> 18:15.940
One day, she started bringing 
homemade rice balls for lunch.

18:16.530 --> 18:20.450
They were pretty ugly rice balls, but...

18:20.890 --> 18:24.680
She looked so happy when she ate them.

18:26.460 --> 18:30.710
After that, she kept growing more and more 
efficient at work, like a different person.

18:31.230 --> 18:32.530
It might've been from gaining confidence,

18:32.530 --> 18:36.210
but she began to sit up straighter
 and got all rosy-cheeked.

18:36.540 --> 18:41.970
I'm thinking that maybe those rice balls 
contained some sort of dangerous drug!

18:42.690 --> 18:44.840
Isn't that an extremely baseless suspicion?

18:45.690 --> 18:48.820
Oh, sorry. Did I ruin your image of her?

18:48.820 --> 18:50.230
Not at all.

18:50.230 --> 18:53.960
It's true that it's 
a little surprising, though.

18:53.960 --> 18:58.740
Actually, I got to know Saku-senpai 
while I was job hunting.

18:59.100 --> 19:01.380
Oh, really?

19:01.380 --> 19:02.160
Yes.

19:02.890 --> 19:05.110
I often saw her on the same train.

19:05.790 --> 19:11.790
She was this beautiful woman 
who always dressed well and stood tall.

19:12.260 --> 19:15.800
There was even a time I admired her,

19:16.130 --> 19:19.520
wanting to become an adult like that 
once I started working in society.

19:20.160 --> 19:20.990
But...

19:21.320 --> 19:22.300
But?

19:22.760 --> 19:25.450
She was actually always fast asleep!

19:25.450 --> 19:27.420
Every morning! Standing!

19:27.420 --> 19:28.310
What?!

19:28.310 --> 19:30.930
Plus, even though she stood on the train 
without holding onto anything,

19:30.930 --> 19:33.310
she never fell over!

19:31.790 --> 19:33.310
Amazing...

19:33.310 --> 19:35.260
Without holding onto anything?!

19:35.260 --> 19:39.320
After that, I kept watching her, 
thinking her core must be crazy strong.

19:39.650 --> 19:40.580
How?!

19:40.580 --> 19:42.360
Is it some kind of special training?!

19:42.360 --> 19:45.830
C
O
