19:42.360 --> 19:45.830
If you think about it, it's a really 
efficient use of your time.

19:46.290 --> 19:49.750
Huh? Then you just happened to 
meet her at the company by chance?

19:49.750 --> 19:50.830
Wow!

19:50.830 --> 19:53.300
It's gotta be destiny! 
Why don't you two get married?

19:53.300 --> 19:55.920
What are the chances 
of that kind of coincidence?

19:56.450 --> 19:59.960
I kept seeing her on the train pretty often.

20:02.330 --> 20:05.340
Please stop. I'll have you come 
with me at the next station.

20:02.330 --> 20:07.970
Saku-senpai noticed I was being harassed 
by a pervert and caught him for me!

20:05.340 --> 20:07.040
What'd you say, you--

20:07.970 --> 20:10.020
She c-c-caught him?!

20:10.020 --> 20:11.890
What? How?!

20:11.890 --> 20:16.530
Yeah, she twisted his arm 
with a practiced motion.

20:16.530 --> 20:18.220
Let me go!

20:16.530 --> 20:18.220
Can you come down with us?

20:18.220 --> 20:19.570
Y-Yes!

20:19.570 --> 20:23.320
Maybe she worked in Japan's 
Self-Defense Force before this?!

20:21.130 --> 20:23.320
I'm really sorry!

20:23.720 --> 20:30.330
I practically forced her name out of her 
and invited her to dinner as a thank you.

20:30.330 --> 20:34.210
I immediately applied once 
I found out where she worked.

20:35.810 --> 20:38.710
Looks like you're the type that doesn't 
give up once you set your sights on something!

20:40.520 --> 20:44.720
I see. So that's why you're so close to her.

20:45.420 --> 20:48.200
I didn't know.

20:48.200 --> 20:51.220
Fukuzawa's beautiful, skilled, 
gets along with others,

20:51.220 --> 20:54.520
and she's even strong in a fight.

20:54.520 --> 20:56.730
I don't think I can beat her on any level.

20:57.090 --> 20:59.980
She's kind of superhuman.

20:59.980 --> 21:03.300
I feel like there are still things 
about her that we don't know!

21:03.300 --> 21:06.140
Like a surprising secret?

21:06.140 --> 21:10.660
No way! It'd be crazy if there was even more!

21:15.450 --> 21:17.880
E-Excuse me.

21:29.180 --> 21:32.430
Roll

21:30.100 --> 21:31.290
You found me out!

21:31.290 --> 21:32.430
Sorry!

